

>> Cat := Into entsha.

Cat xa-kufika: ['entsha'] yenza: {
	eyakho sound := ['meow!'].
}.

Cat xa-kufika: ['nieuw'] yenza: {
	eyakho sound := ['meow!'].
}.

Cat xa-kufika: ['makeSound'] yenza: { <- eyakho sound.
}.

Cat xa-kufika: ['greet'] yenza: { <- ngokwakho makeSound.
}.

>> cat := Cat entsha.
Imveliso bhala: cat greet.
